{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_009","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"For the installation of ComfyUI, it is mainly divided into several steps:","location_hint":"paragraph 77","char_start":1753,"char_end":1826,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_010","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"Create a virtual environment(avoid polluting the system-level Python environment)","location_hint":"paragraph 78","char_start":1829,"char_end":1910,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_011","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"Clone the ComfyUI code repository","location_hint":"paragraph 79","char_start":1912,"char_end":1945,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_012","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"You can also refer to ComfyUI CLI to install ComfyUI, it is a command line tool that can easily install ComfyUI and manage its dependencies.","location_hint":"paragraph 82","char_start":1985,"char_end":2125,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_013","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"Independent virtual environments are necessary because ComfyUI’s dependencies may conflict with other dependencies on the system, and it can also avoid polluting the system-level Python environment.","location_hint":"paragraph 85","char_start":2166,"char_end":2364,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_014","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"Install Miniconda . This will help you install the correct versions of Python and other libraries needed by ComfyUI.\nCreate an environment with Conda.","location_hint":"paragraph 86","char_start":2366,"char_end":2516,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_015","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"conda create -n comfyenv\nconda activate comfyenv","location_hint":"paragraph 87","char_start":2520,"char_end":2568,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_664a4a54b4c3_016","source_id":"src_664a4a54b4c3","source_hash":"c62e4571c3aeadb02f462f4f969b614956dc4d142c956e43ec12a7fcb6967a34","text":"Clone the ComfyUI code repository","location_hint":"paragraph 89","char_start":2578,"char_end":2611,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T05:23:53.667Z"}
